<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n47398" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">taetrĭcus</span></b>  (<b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">tētr-</span></b> ), a,
		um, adj.
		taeter, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>forbidding</i>, <i>harsh</i>, <i>crabbed</i>, <i>gloomy</i>, <i>sour</i>, <i>stern</i>, <i>severe</i> (perh. not ante-Aug.; cf.: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">tristis, severus): puella,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Ov. A.
					A. 1, 721</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Sabinae,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id.
					Am. 3, 8, 61</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">taetricus et asper censor udorum,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Mart. 12, 70, 4</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">lector,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id.
					11, 2, 7</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">deae,</span>”
				i. e. <i>the Fates</i>,
				 <i><span class="en">id.
					4, 73, 6</span></i>
			; <i><span class="en">7, 96, 4</span></i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">taetrica ac tristis disciplina Sabinorum,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Liv.
					1, 18, 4</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">animus (ccupled with horridus),</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Sen. Ep. 36, 3</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">febres,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Mart.
					6, 70, 8</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">tubae,</span>”
				<i>fierce</i>, <i>warlike</i>,
				 <i><span class="en">id.
					7, 80, 2</span></i>
			.</div>
